  "name": "poster-pop",
  "vibe": "A loud kinetic-typography poster reel — every scene is a solid full-bleed colour field, gigantic condensed uppercase type, one giant slow-turning starburst behind everything, and two scrolling marquee rails that never stop. Thick ink outlines and hard offset shadows on every card and chip; the cut is a hard block wipe arriving from a different edge each time. Brand colour swaps every field, marquee and burst. Portrait-native 9:16. Best for launches, statements, music, events and anything that wants to shout.",
